        {
          "say": "Question one: what's the total? Add every percentage that's charged on the balance – the fund, the account, any advice fee. That one number is what you're really paying."
        },
        {
          "say": "Question two: what is it in dollars – this year, and in twenty years? A percentage hides the size. Seventeen dollars sounds fine. Forty-nine hundred a year doesn't."
