        {
          "say": "Question three: what do I get for it? A fee isn't automatically bad. Advice, help with taxes or just a plan you stick to can be worth money. But the fee is certain – the extra benefit isn't. A one percent fee has to earn back one percent, every single year, just to break even."
        },
